    {
      "id": "f85a5406be19",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Then follow the prompts!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "e56cce2ab47b",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Watch an interactive lesson on Scrimba",
          "link": {
            "href": "https://scrimba.com/intro-to-vite-c03p6pbbdq/~0yhj?via=vite",
            "kind": "external"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "19927e159052",
      "kind": "callout",
      "variant": "tip",
      "title": "Compatibility Note",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b374c00d15b9",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Vite requires "
            },
            {
              "text": "Node.js",
              "link": {
                "href": "https://nodejs.org/en/",
                "kind": "external"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": " version 20.19+, 22.12+. However, some templates require a higher Node.js version to work, please upgrade if your package manager warns about it."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "68a405c5ebba",
      "kind": "callout",
      "variant": "note",
      "title": "Using create vite with command line options",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "199663cded13",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "You can also directly specify the project name and the template you want to use via additional command line options. For example, to scaffold a Vite + Vue project, run:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "a016ccafcafd",
          "kind": "tabs",
          "items": [
            {
              "label": "npm",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "e314ed0c3b5c",
                  "kind": "code",
                  "lang": "bash",
                  "text": "# npm 7+, extra double-dash is needed:\nnpm create vite@latest my-vue-app -- --template vue"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "label": "Yarn",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "c03082c8a3ba",
                  "kind": "code",
                  "lang": "bash",
                  "text": "yarn create vite my-vue-app --template vue"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "label": "pnpm",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "466035e695d9",
                  "kind": "code",
                  "lang": "bash",
                  "text": "pnpm create vite my-vue-app --template vue"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "label": "Bun",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "e811b814afc2",
                  "kind": "code",
                  "lang": "bash",
                  "text": "bun create vite my-vue-app --template vue"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "label": "Deno",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "300b2c68d65f",
                  "kind": "code",
                  "lang": "bash",
                  "text": "deno init --npm vite my-vue-app --template vue"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "846005205235",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "See "
            },
            {
              "text": "create-vite",
              "link": {
                "href": "https://github.com/vitejs/vite/tree/main/packages/create-vite",
                "kind": "external"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": " for more details on each supported template: "
            },
            {
              "text": "vanilla",
              "marks": [
                "code"
              ]
            },
            {
